{"id":"595762","name":"马齿苋烤肠沙拉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/595762/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"马齿苋","amount":"100g"},{"name":"烤肠","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒲公英","amount":"小许"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"院子里的马齿苋。","img":"images/595762/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"采一些。","img":"images/595762/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再采一些蒲公英叶子。","img":"images/595762/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗净，放一起。","img":"images/595762/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切几块番茄放进来。","img":"images/595762/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"烤肠切片。","img":"images/595762/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放锅里煎。","img":"images/595762/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煎的火候大一点，油脂就少一点。","img":"images/595762/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"另一些买的马齿苋。","img":"images/595762/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/595762/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"煎好的肠放这边，拌匀。","img":"images/595762/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/595762/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取沙拉酱。","img":"images/595762/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"挤上沙拉酱即可。","img":"images/595762/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/595762/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}